msgstr "Ah..."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "412_Akiyama"
msgid "Now, just calm down. Let's head up to my office and I'll\\r\nhear what you have to say."
msgstr "Cálmese, vamos a mi oficina y escucharé lo que\\r\ntenga que decir."

